bcg729
------------------------------------------
Bcg729 is a software G729A encoder and decoder library written in C, developed
by Belledonne Communications, the company supporting the Linphone project. It
was written from scratch and is NOT a derivative work of ITU reference source
code in any kind.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  libbcg729-devel-1.1.2-1bl1
  libbcg729_0-1.1.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.4-2

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.2.1-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/bcg729/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/bcg729/archive/refs/tags/1.1.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack bcg729-1.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./bcg729-1.1.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/bcg729-1.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/bcg729-1.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbcg729_0-1.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbcg729-devel-1.1.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(bcg729)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/bcg729.README
  /usr/share/doc/bcg729/AUTHORS.md
  /usr/share/doc/bcg729/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/bcg729/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/bcg729/README.md

(libbcg729_0)
  /usr/bin/cygbcg729-0.dll

(libbcg729-devel)
  /usr/include/bcg729/decoder.h
  /usr/include/bcg729/encoder.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/BCG729/BCG729Config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/BCG729/BCG729ConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/BCG729/BCG729Targets-release.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/BCG729/BCG729Targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libbcg729.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libbcg729.pc

